    "title": "Fat Bear Week Begins with Chubby Cubby Contest",
    "text": "• Fat Bear Week is an annual online voting contest to determine the fattest bear.\n• The event takes place on the Alaska Peninsula.\n• The main event featuring adult bears starts next week.\n• A preliminary contest called 'Fat Bear Jr.' is held for adolescent bears.\n• Voting for Fat Bear Jr. is open until Friday.\n• The winner of Fat Bear Jr. will advance to the main contest.",
